---
title: Stuffed Mushrooms
author: Joyce Geddes
category: Appetizers & Dips
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@cream cheese{1%8-oz pkg}
@garlic salt{1%Dash}
@finely minced onions{1/2%tsp}
@finely chopped green pepper{1/8%c}
@crab meat{1%can}
@crushed parsley{1%Dash}
@Large fresh mushrooms

Take the stems out of large fresh mushrooms, wash and dip in bread crumbs. Fill with crab meat mixture. Bake at 350 degrees for 10 minutes.
